# FLOPS UI craft

When doing visual/UI work (layout, polish, typography, motion, color, components, or anti-slop cleanup):

1. Read the installed design skills: **emil-design-eng**, **impeccable**, and **design-taste** (under `.cursor/skills/`).
2. Read and follow `docs/design-system.md`.

## Precedence

`docs/design-system.md` and FLOPS product constraints **win** over generic landing-page or skill defaults:

- Notebook restraint: calm, precise, physical — data is the personality; UI is the frame
- No Inter / Geist / system-default typography stacks when the design system specifies otherwise
- No vibe-slop or generic “AI SaaS” chrome

## Anti-slop (consistent with de-slop)

- No sparkles / ✨ glyphs
- No lavender / purple AI chrome, gradients, or glow on buttons and selection
- No emoji decoration as UI affordances
- Prefer flat semantic color and cool neutrals over decorative accents
